@startuml build_flow
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif

title BUILD 卡牌结算流程

actor Caller
participant "GameCore" as GC
participant "CardDef" as CD
participant "CardResolver" as CR
participant "BuildResolver" as BR

== 1. 校验 ==
Caller -> GC: play_round([BUILD], [ATTACK],\nbuild_target_1=ATTACK)
activate GC
GC -> GC: ① _validate():\n energy>0, build_target 不为 None,\n cost<=energy

== 2. 构建解析任务 ==
GC -> GC: ② 遍历 cards_1, cards_2
GC -> GC: ③ 创建 ResolveContext\n(BUILD 卡传入 build_target=ATTACK)

GC -> CD: ④ get_card_def(card_type).resolvers
CD --> GC: [BuildResolver, ...]

== 3. 调度解析 ==
GC -> CR: ⑤ resolve(tasks)
activate CR
CR -> CR: ⑥ 按 priority 降序排序 (12>11>10)

loop 每个 (resolver, ctx)
    CR -> BR: ⑦ resolve(ctx, details)
    activate BR
    BR -> CD: ⑧ get_card_def(ctx.build_target)
    CD --> BR: CardDef(build_cost=1)
    BR -> BR: ⑨ card_owner.energy -= build_cost
    BR -> BR: ⑩ card_owner.discard_pile\n.append(build_target)
    BR -> BR: ⑪ details.add("BUILD ATTACK (cost 1)")
    deactivate BR
end

CR --> GC: ResolutionResult(details)
deactivate CR

== 4. 收尾 ==
GC -> GC: ⑫ 弃置已打出卡牌
GC -> GC: ⑬ 记录 PlayerHistoryItem\n(BUILD, build_target=ATTACK)
GC -> GC: ⑭ 处理回合结束
GC --> Caller: RoundResult

deactivate GC

@enduml
